#: quick_edit.py:1320
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Pick an image from disk. The file browser opens once this popup is out of its way"
msgstr "从磁盘选择图像。此弹窗关闭后，文件浏览器会打开"

#: op_picker.py:378
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Pick the material under the cursor and make it active.\nHold the swap key to assign it to the selection instead"
msgstr "拾取光标下的材质并将其设为活动。\n按住切换键可改为将其分配给选中项"

