msgid "Single User Copy"
msgstr "单用户副本"

#: screen_tools.py:209
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split the viewport and put a Shader Editor under it. Press again to close it. Preferences can make it open in its own window instead"
msgstr "拆分视图并在其下方放置着色器编辑器。再次按下可关闭。偏好设置可改为在独立窗口中打开"

#: quick_edit.py:1129
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Stop editing the borrowed material and go back to the material of the object that is open in Edit Mode"
msgstr "停止编辑借用的材质，返回在编辑模式中打开的物体的材质"

